# Project Skills

Skills live in `.agents/skills/` and are locked in `skills-lock.json`.

## Writing

- **stop-slop** — Edit newsletter copy; remove AI filler and formulaic prose.
- **newsletter-voice** (this repo’s `.cursor/rules/newsletter-voice.mdc`) — Professional, fan-first tone with grit and heart.

## Design & UI

- **ui-ux-pro-max** — Layout, palettes, typography, components, accessibility, stack patterns (Tailwind, shadcn, Next.js).
- **frontend-design** — Distinctive visual direction; avoid generic AI aesthetics. Use for initial brand and landing/archive pages.

When both apply: **frontend-design** sets the bold direction; **ui-ux-pro-max** refines UX, spacing, and accessibility.

## React / Next.js (CLI install names)

- **vercel-react-best-practices** — Performance, data fetching, bundle size, RSC (repo folder: `react-best-practices`).
- **vercel-composition-patterns** — Compound components, fewer boolean props (repo folder: `composition-patterns`).

## Install commands (reference)

```bash
npx skills add https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-skills --skill vercel-react-best-practices
npx skills add https://github.com/vercel-labs/agent-skills --skill vercel-composition-patterns
npx skills add https://github.com/anthropics/skills --skill frontend-design
```
